      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T07:09:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In a VoIP call at least on track metadata will have usage AUDIO_USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION. You can also expect AUDIO_USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION_SIGNALLING to be active for some time during the call.\n\nfor PSTN calls, this meta data is injected by the audio HAL and I assume they use  AUDIO_USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION",
      "parentUuid": "bd5a0bf0_579521e5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2947,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 2953,
        "endChar": 7
      },
      "revId": "4c08bc347a3aed52a55eb5776eb42ea715f95132",
