      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T07:23:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Eric, Thanks for the information.\n\nYup, for PSTN call offload case, we will send AUDIO_USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION, and skip all the other source metadata update to bluetooth audio HAL during the call period.\n\nIs it the same behavior for the SW path?",
      "parentUuid": "7cdb6d26_b50bf80e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2947,
        "startChar": 6,
        "endLine": 2953,
        "endChar": 7
