      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T07:33:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On the SW path for PSTN, the audio framework adds one \"virtual track\" with usage AUDIO_USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION which makes sure at least one of the metadata received by the HAL has usage AUDIO_USAGE_VOICE_COMMUNICATION. But the framework does not filter out other metadata",
      "parentUuid": "dc859ab5_483ed08b",
